A1: adding of -io/a to the words in -o/a (a>ia, o>io|[^cijɉñ]o, [lnr]>-io)
X0: genderless plural ([aeo]>i, [lnr]>-e/i)
X1: genderless abstract nouns (ade>ae|à|è, ude>ú/úe)

B1: feltrin-belumat transformation, plural with transformation '[aeou][ln] > 'Vi (.>i|[èò][ln], a.>ài|a[ln], e.>éi|e[ln], o.>ói|o[ln], u.>úi|u[ln])
